{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04017","headline":"奉和姚令公温汤旧馆永怀故人卢公之作 · 苏頲","name":"奉和姚令公温汤旧馆永怀故人卢公之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树德岂孤迈，降神良竝出。\n伟兹廊庙桢，调彼盐梅实。\n正悦虞垂举，翻悲郑侨卒。\n同心不可忘，交臂何爲失。\n清路荷前幸，明时称右弼。\n曾联野外游，尚记帷中密。\n新恸情莫遣，旧游词更述。\n空令还辱和，长叹知音日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}